      "description": "Data repository for solar and meteorological ground measurements from a network of weather stations in West Africa. The data is provided in the framework of the West African Power Pool project: \"Solar Development in Sub-Saharan Africa - Solar resource measurement campaign in West Africa”. Funding is provided by World Bank. Measurement Date Range: - Bougouni: 2021-04-28 – 2023-04-27 - Fana: 2021-04-29 – 2023-04-28 - Sanankoroba: 2021-04-28 – 2023-04-27 - Sikasso: 2021-09-30 – 2023-09-29 - Manantali: 2021-11-09 – 2023-11-08",
